---
// The landing page's diagram: people on the web, the Hub, and Runners that each run Claude Code
// in a Sandbox, behind a credential proxy on the host. Built from HTML rather than one SVG, so it reflows into
// a column on a phone and its text stays readable at every width.
---

<figure class="how" aria-labelledby="how-caption">
  <div class="flow">
    <section class="node people" aria-label="People">
      <p class="kicker">Browsers</p>
      <h3>People</h3>
      <p>Sign in to the web UI, start Sessions, send prompts, watch Claude work and type into its terminal.</p>
      <div class="faces" aria-hidden="true"><span>AL</span><span>SN</span><span>MK</span></div>
    </section>

    <div class="wire" aria-hidden="true"><span class="label">/ws/web</span></div>

    <section class="node hub" aria-label="The Hub">
      <p class="kicker">One server</p>
      <h3>Hub</h3>
      <p>Knows every Session, Runner and Participant. Keeps the Prompt queues and Environments, and relays prompts and events.</p>
      <ul class="chips" aria-label="What the Hub keeps">
        <li>Sign-in</li>
        <li>SQLite</li>
        <li>GitHub App</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <div class="wire fork" aria-hidden="true"><span class="label">/ws/runner</span></div>

    <div class="runners">
      {
        ["studio-mac", "build-box"].map((name) => (
          <section class="node runner" aria-label={`Runner ${name}`}>
            <p class="kicker">Runner</p>
            <h3>{name}</h3>
            <div class="host">
              <span class="dot" aria-hidden="true" />
              <span>
                <b>Credential proxy</b>, holding the Claude credential
              </span>
            </div>
            <div class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">
              Session token <span>↑</span>
            </div>
            <div class="sandbox">
              <span class="dot" aria-hidden="true" />
              <span>
                <b>Sandbox</b> microVM with <code>/workspace</code>: Claude Code and every tool it runs
              </span>
            </div>
          </section>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </div>
  <figcaption id="how-caption">
    Claude Code and its tools run in the Session's Sandbox with only a Session token. The Runner's
    credential proxy sends its requests on with the real credential, which the Sandbox never sees.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .how {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .flow {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0;
    align-items: center;
  }
  @media (min-width: 56rem) {
    .flow {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.9fr) 5.5rem minmax(0, 1fr) 5.5rem minmax(0, 1.25fr);
    }
  }

  .node {
    position: relative;
    border: 1px solid var(--ch-line);
    border-radius: 0.8rem;
    background: var(--ch-surface-raised);
    padding: 1rem 1.1rem 1.1rem;
  }
  .node h3 {
    margin: 0 0 0.35rem;
    font-size: var(--sl-text-lg);
    color: var(--sl-color-white);
  }
  .node p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: var(--sl-text-sm);
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
  }
  .node .kicker {
    margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
    font-family: var(--sl-font-mono);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
  }
  .hub {
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--sl-color-accent) 55%, var(--ch-line));
    box-shadow: 0 18px 50px -24px var(--ch-glow);
  }
  .hub .kicker {
    color: var(--sl-color-accent-high);
  }

  .faces {
    display: flex;
    margin-top: 0.8rem;
  }
  .faces span {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 1.6rem;
    height: 1.6rem;
    margin-inline-end: -0.35rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 2px solid var(--ch-surface-raised);
    font-size: 0.58rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #fff;
    background: #3d5dcf;
  }
  .faces span:nth-child(2) {
    background: #0f8a7e;
  }
  .faces span:nth-child(3) {
    background: #8a5a12;
  }

  .chips {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    margin: 0.8rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }
  .chips li {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0.1rem 0.5rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-family: var(--sl-font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: var(--sl-color-accent-high);
    background: var(--sl-color-accent-low);
  }

  .runners {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }
  .runner h3 {
    font-family: var(--sl-font-mono);
    font-size: var(--sl-text-base);
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }
  .host,
  .sandbox {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.55rem;
    align-items: baseline;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.65rem;
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    font-size: var(--sl-text-xs);
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
  }
  .host b,
  .sandbox b {
    color: var(--sl-color-white);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .host {
    background: var(--ch-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--ch-line);
  }
  .sandbox {
    border: 1px dashed color-mix(in srgb, var(--sl-color-green) 60%, var(--ch-line));
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--sl-color-green) 7%, transparent);
  }
  .sandbox code {
    font-size: 0.95em;
    background: none;
    padding: 0;
  }
  .dot {
    flex: none;
    width: 0.5rem;
    height: 0.5rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--sl-color-accent);
    transform: translateY(-0.05rem);
  }
  .sandbox .dot {
    background: var(--sl-color-green);
  }
  .arrow {
    padding: 0.2rem 0 0.2rem 1.6rem;
    font-family: var(--sl-font-mono);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
  }

  /* The wires between the columns: vertical when stacked, horizontal side by side, where the
     one from the Hub forks to each Runner. */
  .wire {
    --wire: color-mix(in srgb, var(--sl-color-accent) 65%, var(--ch-line));
    position: relative;
    height: 3rem;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
  }
  .wire::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset-block: 0;
    inset-inline-start: calc(50% - 0.75px);
    border-inline-start: 1.5px solid var(--wire);
  }
  .wire .label {
    position: relative;
    padding: 0.1rem 0.45rem;
    border-radius: 0.3rem;
    font-family: var(--sl-font-mono);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
    background: var(--sl-color-bg);
  }
  @media (min-width: 56rem) {
    .wire {
      height: auto;
      align-self: stretch;
    }
    .wire::before {
      inset-block: calc(50% - 0.75px) auto;
      inset-inline: 0;
      border-inline-start: none;
      border-block-start: 1.5px solid var(--wire);
    }
    .wire .label {
      padding: 0;
      background: none;
      font-size: 0.62rem;
      transform: translateY(-0.8rem);
    }
    /* The fork: half a line from the Hub, then a bracket out to the middle of each Runner. */
    .fork::before {
      inset-inline: 0 28%;
    }
    .fork::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset-block: 25%;
      inset-inline: 72% 0;
      border: 1.5px solid var(--wire);
      border-inline-end: none;
      border-start-start-radius: 0.6rem;
      border-end-start-radius: 0.6rem;
    }
    .fork .label {
      justify-self: start;
      margin-inline-start: 0.15rem;
    }
  }

  figcaption {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    max-width: 44rem;
    font-size: var(--sl-text-sm);
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
  }
</style>
